  id: ending_home_high
  lines:
  - speakerId: Jamie
    text: A light comes on in the garage. It is small, but it is deliberate.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact: 
    grantedFact: 
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Jamie
    text: The garage light reaches the old map on the wall.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact: 
    grantedFact: 
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Jamie
    text: Jamie clears a space on the workbench beside the travel-fund jar.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact: 
    grantedFact: 
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Jamie
    text: The wagon stays parked, repaired but not made into a verdict.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact: 
    grantedFact: 
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Jamie
    text: From the open door, the neighborhood looks like work that can begin.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact: 
    grantedFact: 
    nextLineIndex: -1
